    CPOS-E-030,E-032: Decouple analytics_v2 top-level imports and add pure-NumPy ScoreBacktester HAC fallback
    
    Ledger IDs: E-030, E-032
    - Remove unconditional top-level statsmodels import in compounderos_app/analytics_v2.py so DipTriggerAnalyzer, IncrementalRoicAnalyzer, and scanner_service.alerts import cleanly without statsmodels/scipy.
    - Implement deterministic pure-NumPy Newey-West Bartlett HAC fallback and Spearman rank IC in ScoreBacktester.rank_ic_newey_west.
    - Add unit tests for ScoreBacktester in compounderos_app/test_v2_core.py.

